│                          │ while reducing overfitting; CRY gates aggregate adjacent pairs along legal winning-line   │
│                          │ segments; center-to-edge CRY gates help route diagonal and center-line information        │
│                          │ through the allowed grid connectivity; final shared RY/RX readout rotations improve       │
│                          │ measurement alignment for the fixed  observables. Parameter sharing reduces the model to  │
│                          │ 90 total parameters while preserving symmetry and using entanglement more                 │
│                          │ task-specifically than the seed CZ-only mesh.                                             │
